      "widgets_values": [
        "ComfyCrawler HUD portrait pipeline - Kontext edition (mirrors server.generate_kontext_portrait_set).\n- IDLE group: krea2 makes one bust.  Swap the character in node 10.\n- ATTACK / BLOCK / HURT: FLUX.1 Kontext EDITS the idle image (ReferenceLatent = idle latent).\n  Kontext keeps the face; only the expression changes.  Edit the instruction in nodes 30 / 40 / 50.\n- Runs at 256px (no FluxKontextImageScale) - fine for the ~112px HUD slot and ~5x faster.\n  128px still does the open-mouth attack but drops the subtle block/hurt edits.\n- Knobs: KSampler 'steps' on the Kontext samplers (20 = quality, ~12 = faster), FluxGuidance\n  'guidance' (2.5 default; higher = follows the instruction harder).  cfg stays 1.0.\n- Loads krea2 (13GB) + Kontext (12GB) + t5xxl - ComfyUI swaps them; expect a pause between groups."
      ]
    }
